    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into a magical adventure like no other!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever wondered what it would be like to be a rock, an olive, or a small, perfectly rollable sphere?<br>Ever dreamed of racing downhill at breakneck speed, just to go faster than your friends and claim victory?<br>Look no further\u2014<strong>welcome to Digitum!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, you take on the role of an old, used magician, pushing objects through finger-sized portals simply because\u2026 well, you\u2019re bored and you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the player, you control one of these curious little objects, guiding it from portal to portal in a never-ending game of whimsical physics and chaotic fun, trying to improve the time you take to finish a level !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The goal of the game is to complete each level as quickly as possible while avoiding obstacles that add time to your timer.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To move forward, you give an impulse to the object you control. A loading bar displayed beneath the object indicates the strength of the impulse. If the bar turns red, an additional boost is triggered, making you go even faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a multiplayer mode with a real-time leaderboard showing the scores of your friends and the top players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many successes can be unlocked by completing challenges \u2014 some of which are hidden \u2014 and allow you to obtain new skins for your object.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into a magical adventure like no other!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever wondered what it would be like to be a rock, an olive, or a small, perfectly rollable sphere?<br>Ever dreamed of racing downhill at breakneck speed, just to go faster than your friends and claim victory?<br>Look no further\u2014<strong>welcome to Digitum!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, you take on the role of an old, used magician, pushing objects through finger-sized portals simply because\u2026 well, you\u2019re bored and you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the player, you control one of these curious little objects, guiding it from portal to portal in a never-ending game of whimsical physics and chaotic fun, trying to improve the time you take to finish a level !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The goal of the game is to complete each level as quickly as possible while avoiding obstacles that add time to your timer.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To move forward, you give an impulse to the object you control. A loading bar displayed beneath the object indicates the strength of the impulse. If the bar turns red, an additional boost is triggered, making you go even faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a multiplayer mode with a real-time leaderboard showing the scores of your friends and the top players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many successes can be unlocked by completing challenges \u2014 some of which are hidden \u2014 and allow you to obtain new skins for your object.</p>",
    "short_description": "A bored old wizard pokes his finger into a tiny portal \u2014 and you fall out! In this fast-paced arcade adventure, race through twisted levels, master the physics, and perfect your runs to beat the clock\u2026 and your friends on the leaderboard.",
